    "body": "## Summary\n\n`benchmarks/kernels/benchmark_moe.py` casts MoE expert weights with `FP8_DTYPE` (`current_platform.fp8_dtype()`, e4m3fnuz on gfx942) then builds `FusedMoEQuantConfig` with hardcoded `torch.float8_e4m3fn`.\n\n`FusedMoEQuantConfig.use_fp8_w8a8` is `quant_dtype == current_platform.fp8_dtype()`. On FNUZ those disagree, so `use_fp8_w8a8` is False and `--dtype fp8_w8a8` tuning dies in the unquantized path.\n\nThis change sets `quant_dtype = FP8_DTYPE` so the config matches the weight cast.\n\nFixes #54067\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pytest tests/kernels/moe/test_benchmark_moe_fp8_quant_dtype.py` (AST-level branch coverage for fp8 / int8 / unquantized)",
